{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)startServerCommunication","title":"startServerCommunication","roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startServerCommunication","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"startServerCommunication","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/startServerCommunication"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables communication with Pushwoosh servers."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/startservercommunication"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startServerCommunication"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts or resumes communication with Pushwoosh servers. This allows the SDK to send and receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"data including device registration, tags, push tokens, and analytics.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method after the user has consented to data collection, or to re-enable"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"communication after it was previously stopped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable communication after GDPR consent:"}]},{"code":["class ConsentManager {","","    func handleUserConsent(accepted: Bool) {","        if accepted {","            \/\/ User accepted data collection","            Pushwoosh.configure.startServerCommunication()","","            \/\/ Register for push after consent","            Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications()","","            \/\/ Sync any pending user data","            syncPendingUserData()","","            Logger.info(\"User consented - Pushwoosh communication enabled\")","        } else {","            \/\/ User declined - disable communication","            Pushwoosh.configure.stopServerCommunication()","            Logger.info(\"User declined - Pushwoosh communication disabled\")","        }","","        UserDefaults.standard.set(accepted, forKey: \"gdprConsent\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"called ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopServerCommunication"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/startServerCommunication":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/startservercommunication","title":"startServerCommunication","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables communication with Pushwoosh servers."}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startServerCommunication"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"ki